## Scope

A control panel section with:
- a physics on/off toggle;
- a tissue compliance control;
- a pose-following compliance control;
- a damping control;
- a gravity strength control, scaled so the effect can be made visible on an upright face;
- a reset-simulation action.
Show it only when the new `VITE_ENABLE_PHYSICS_PANEL` flag is set, following the existing optional-panel pattern, and document the flag in the example env file. Settings apply live to the running solver.

## Files

New panel under `src/components/controls/`, `src/layout/dashboard-regions.tsx`, `src/config/env.ts`, `.env.example`

## Dependencies

Depends on: Physics deformation provider

